    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRESENTATION</h2><br>This is a classic 2D retro RPG.<br><br>The world is divided in three realms.<br>Those who have risen live in Eden,<br>those who still struggle live in Middle World<br>and those who failed live in Underworld.<br><br>Eden is the realm that keeps the world together, when a unknown force threatens it's balance, it's time for an incursion between all realms to find the solution.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br> * Dynamic Party System: Switch between parties, each with their unique characters and conflicts<br> * Lush world beautifully designed with varied and vast locations<br> * A menacing cast of enemies to be defeated<br> * Carefully composed soundtrack<br> * Mouse Support<br> * Autosave",
